# game/Scenes/Suzy/suzy5.rpy:16
translate italian suzy5_3c671076:

    # "I sit down in the driver's seat and start the car, not yet decided on how I am going to spend the rest of my night."
    "Mi siedo al posto di guida e metto in moto l’auto, senza aver ancora deciso come trascorrerò il resto della serata."

# game/Scenes/Suzy/suzy5.rpy:17
translate italian suzy5_ed1fbe56:

    # "Then my phone starts buzzing."
    "Poi il mio telefono inizia a vibrare."

# game/Scenes/Suzy/suzy5.rpy:21
translate italian suzy5_702d39f2:

    # "I'm not sure who it is, but it is a local number."
    "Non so chi sia, ma è un numero locale."

# game/Scenes/Suzy/suzy5.rpy:25
translate italian suzy5_bea5e8cb:

    # pc "Hello?"
    pc "Pronto?"

# game/Scenes/Suzy/suzy5.rpy:26
translate italian suzy5_b1036369:

    # ss "Hey [bro], it's me, Suzy."
    ss "Ehi [bro], sono io, Suzy."

# game/Scenes/Suzy/suzy5.rpy:27
translate italian suzy5_813bfe8e:

    # pc "Oh hey, [sis]."
    pc "Oh ciao, [sis]."

# game/Scenes/Suzy/suzy5.rpy:28
translate italian suzy5_6cfa6df6:

    # ss "Could you help me with something please?"
    ss "Potresti aiutarmi con una cosa, per favore?"

# game/Scenes/Suzy/suzy5.rpy:29
translate italian suzy5_77c062fa:

    # ss "I'm sitting in the supermarket parking lot and my car won't start."
    ss "Sono nel parcheggio del supermercato e la mia auto non parte."

# game/Scenes/Suzy/suzy5.rpy:30
translate italian suzy5_0c01ea35:

    # ss "I don't know what to do, can you just come help me?"
    ss "Non so cosa fare, potresti venire ad aiutarmi?"

# game/Scenes/Suzy/suzy5.rpy:31
translate italian suzy5_3c4ee749:

    # pc "Sure, I'm close. I'll be there in a minute."
    pc "Certo, sono qui vicino. Arrivo tra un minuto."

# game/Scenes/Suzy/suzy5.rpy:33
translate italian suzy5_d41d8cd9:

    # voice 'voices/suzy_thanks2.mp3'
    voice 'voices/suzy_thanks2.mp3'

# game/Scenes/Suzy/suzy5.rpy:34
translate italian suzy5_4ce6f4f0:

    # ss "Thanks."
    ss "Grazie."

# game/Scenes/Suzy/suzy5.rpy:36
translate italian suzy5_cc61d61a:

    # "I hang up and drive over to the supermarket."
    "Riattacco e guido fino al supermercato."

# game/Scenes/Suzy/suzy5.rpy:39
translate italian suzy5_4e12cf19:

    # "I spot Suzy's car pretty quick and park right next to it."
    "Individuo l’auto di Suzy abbastanza in fretta e parcheggio proprio accanto a lei."

# game/Scenes/Suzy/suzy5.rpy:42
translate italian suzy5_a60d89b8:

    # "Suzy runs up to me immediately after I step out of the car."
    "Suzy mi corre incontro subito dopo che sono scesa dall’auto."

# game/Scenes/Suzy/suzy5.rpy:43
translate italian suzy5_96fd56fd:

    # ss "I don't know what happened!"
    ss "Non so cosa sia successo!"

# game/Scenes/Suzy/suzy5.rpy:44
translate italian suzy5_4ce21989:

    # ss "I just came out of the store after doing some shopping and it won't start!"
    ss "Sono appena uscita dal negozio dopo aver fatto la spesa e non parte!"

# game/Scenes/Suzy/suzy5.rpy:45
translate italian suzy5_a56c45eb:

    # ss "I can't afford to take it to a mechanic right now. I barely make anything at Java Lava and Mom is broke."
    ss "Al momento non posso permettermi di portarla da un meccanico. Guadagno a malapena qualcosa al Java Lava e la mamma è al verde."

# game/Scenes/Suzy/suzy5.rpy:48
translate italian suzy5_a9852df6:

    # ss "I hope so. I don't know what I'll do if I don't have my car."
    ss "Lo spero proprio. Non so cosa farei se non avessi la mia auto."

# game/Scenes/Suzy/suzy5.rpy:50
translate italian suzy5_1845952a:

    # ss "Will you look at it please?"
    ss "Potresti darle un'occhiata, per favore?"

# game/Scenes/Suzy/suzy5.rpy:53
translate italian suzy5_da8c2e7f:

    # ss "Yes, please. Fix it, [bro]."
    ss "Sì, per favore. Riparala, [bro]."

# game/Scenes/Suzy/suzy5.rpy:56
translate italian suzy5_f393635e:

    # ss "I don't!"
    ss "Non ne ho idea!"

# game/Scenes/Suzy/suzy5.rpy:58
translate italian suzy5_31115693:

    # ss "Can you just see if you can fix it please?"
    ss "Puoi solo vedere se riesci a sistemarlo, per favore?"

# game/Scenes/Suzy/suzy5.rpy:59
translate italian suzy5_c3f59e51:

    # pc "Yeah, let's see what's up with it."
    pc "Sì, vediamo cosa c'è che non va."

# game/Scenes/Suzy/suzy5.rpy:60
translate italian suzy5_4103549c:

    # ss "Thank you, [bro]. I'm freaking out."
    ss "Grazie, [bro]. Sto dando di matto."

# game/Scenes/Suzy/suzy5.rpy:63
translate italian suzy5_5aa7230b:

    # "I pop the hood and look inside for any problems."
    "Alzo il cofano e guardo dentro per vedere se ci sono problemi."

# game/Scenes/Suzy/suzy5.rpy:64
translate italian suzy5_c9096016:

    # "I'm not really a mechanic or anything and only know a little about cars, but after jiggling a few wires around, I find her battery cable had slid off one of the pegs."
    "Non sono proprio un meccanico né niente del genere e so solo un po' di auto, ma dopo aver smosso un po' i cavi, scopro che il cavo della batteria si era sfilato da uno dei ganci."

# game/Scenes/Suzy/suzy5.rpy:65
translate italian suzy5_1ffc433c:

    # "I carefully slide it back down where it is supposed to go and then use one of my keys to tighten the screw so it wouldn't fall off again."
    "Lo rimetto con cura al suo posto e poi uso una delle mie chiavi per stringere la vite, così non si staccherà di nuovo."

# game/Scenes/Suzy/suzy5.rpy:66
translate italian suzy5_00654239:

    # pc "Go try to start it again."
    pc "Provo ad avviarla di nuovo."

# game/Scenes/Suzy/suzy5.rpy:67
translate italian suzy5_5c646e65:

    # ss "Okay."
    ss "Ok."

# game/Scenes/Suzy/suzy5.rpy:70
translate italian suzy5_11b9b96f:

    # "She gets into the driver's side and turns the key and her car starts right up again."
    "Lei sale al posto di guida, gira la chiave e la sua auto si avvia subito."

# game/Scenes/Suzy/suzy5.rpy:74
translate italian suzy5_bcd70141:

    # ss "You did it!"
    ss "Ce l’hai fatta!"

# game/Scenes/Suzy/suzy5.rpy:75
translate italian suzy5_8b9f1772:

    # ss "Oh my God, thank you so much."
    ss "Oh mio Dio, grazie mille."

# game/Scenes/Suzy/suzy5.rpy:76
translate italian suzy5_e161b9ae:

    # ss "Best [brother] ever!"
    ss "Il migliore [brother] di sempre!"

# game/Scenes/Suzy/suzy5.rpy:79
translate italian suzy5_86ca1882:

    # "She rushes up and wraps her arms around me, pulling me into a tight hug."
    "Si precipita verso di me e mi avvolge con le braccia, stringendomi in un abbraccio forte."

# game/Scenes/Suzy/suzy5.rpy:82
translate italian suzy5_7eb555a1:

    # "Then she pulls away, but only slightly, staring up at me with a strange look in her eyes."
    "Poi si stacca, ma solo leggermente, fissandomi con uno sguardo strano negli occhi."

# game/Scenes/Suzy/suzy5.rpy:85
translate italian suzy5_842415b0:

    # "Without warning, she leans in and put her lips on mine."
    "Senza preavviso, si avvicina e posa le sue labbra sulle mie."

# game/Scenes/Suzy/suzy5.rpy:86
translate italian suzy5_8b1faa90:

    # "It is almost a chaste kiss, but not quite. Her hand is on my chest and there is a passion behind it."
    "È quasi un bacio casto, ma non del tutto. La sua mano è sul mio petto e c’è una passione dietro quel gesto."

# game/Scenes/Suzy/suzy5.rpy:87
translate italian suzy5_8e0321b2:

    # "This isn't just a friendly peck. I feel an urge behind it, like she wants more."
    "Questo non è solo un bacio amichevole. Sento un desiderio dietro di esso, come se lei volesse di più."

# game/Scenes/Suzy/suzy5.rpy:91
translate italian suzy5_34527ef1:

    # ss "Uh, sorry."
    ss "Ehm, scusa."

# game/Scenes/Suzy/suzy5.rpy:92
translate italian suzy5_b669988f:

    # ss "I shouldn't have done that, huh?"
    ss "Non avrei dovuto farlo, eh?"

# game/Scenes/Suzy/suzy5.rpy:96
translate italian suzy5_6cb7ce9a:

    # ss "Really?"
    ss "Davvero?"

# game/Scenes/Suzy/suzy5.rpy:97
translate italian suzy5_8577d189:

    # pc "No, it was nice."
    pc "No, è stato bello."

# game/Scenes/Suzy/suzy5.rpy:98
translate italian suzy5_721098ed:

    # ss "I thought so too."
    ss "Lo pensavo anch’io."

# game/Scenes/Suzy/suzy5.rpy:100
translate italian suzy5_fe4100b4:

    # ss "Anyway, I should go."
    ss "Comunque, devo andare."

# game/Scenes/Suzy/suzy5.rpy:102
translate italian suzy5_d41d8cd9_1:

    # voice 'voices/suzy_thanks2.mp3'
    voice 'voices/suzy_thanks2.mp3'

# game/Scenes/Suzy/suzy5.rpy:103
translate italian suzy5_2ec2b18b:

    # ss "Thanks again, [bro]."
    ss "Grazie ancora, [bro]."

# game/Scenes/Suzy/suzy5.rpy:104
translate italian suzy5_c46a0b54:

    # pc "Any time."
    pc "Quando vuoi."

# game/Scenes/Suzy/suzy5.rpy:106
translate italian suzy5_bd7daf33:

    # ss "Right. Sorry."
    ss "Giusto. Scusa."

# game/Scenes/Suzy/suzy5.rpy:107
translate italian suzy5_55a0a639:

    # ss "I should go."
    ss "Devo andare."

# game/Scenes/Suzy/suzy5.rpy:108
translate italian suzy5_45b1beab:

    # ss "Thanks for fixing my car."
    ss "Grazie per avermi sistemato la macchina."

# game/Scenes/Suzy/suzy5.rpy:112
translate italian suzy5_f6f30a26:

    # "With that, she gets into her car and I get into mine and we both drive away."
    "Detto questo, lei sale in macchina, io salgo nella mia e ce ne andiamo entrambi."

# game/Scenes/Suzy/suzy5.rpy:113
translate italian suzy5_49ed461b:

    # "What was with that kiss?"
    "Che senso aveva quel bacio?"

# game/Scenes/Suzy/suzy5.rpy:115
translate italian suzy5_78e50149:

    # "She definitely seems like she is interested in me. That kiss felt amazing."
    "Sembra proprio che sia interessata a me. Quel bacio è stato fantastico."

# game/Scenes/Suzy/suzy5.rpy:116
translate italian suzy5_2c26c150:

    # "Somehow, her being my [sister] makes it even hotter."
    "In qualche modo, il fatto che lei sia la mia [sister] rende tutto ancora più eccitante."

# game/Scenes/Suzy/suzy5.rpy:117
translate italian suzy5_8ea91748:

    # "I wonder if she would go further?"
    "Chissà se andrebbe oltre?"

# game/Scenes/Suzy/suzy5.rpy:119
translate italian suzy5_47e765a1:

    # "She seems like she is actually interested in me romantically."
    "Sembra davvero interessata a me dal punto di vista sentimentale."

# game/Scenes/Suzy/suzy5.rpy:120
translate italian suzy5_1ec25cb0:

    # "But, she is my [sister], so we can't do anything like that."
    "Ma è la mia [sister], quindi non possiamo fare nulla del genere."

# game/Scenes/Suzy/suzy5.rpy:121
translate italian suzy5_32823086:

    # "I need to put a stop to this."
    "Devo porre fine a questa situazione."

